data: {"id": "09c48900639248a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1562", "run_id": "09c48900639248a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据汇总\n\n### 支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 的证据（已确认为 command/args 错误导致的运行时崩溃）\n\n1. **kubectl describe 确认退出码 127、Reason=Error**\n   - Container `app` 的 Last State: Terminated, Reason=Error, Exit Code=127\n   - Exit Code 127 在 Linux/sh 中明确表示\"command not found\"\n   - Restart Count: 9 次，Back-off 5m0s（指数退避已触发）\n\n2. **Pod YAML 确认 command/args 配置**\n   - `Command: sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command`\n   - 镜像: `python:3-alpine`（一个精简的 Python/Alpine 容器，不含 `/opt/app/unavailable-command`）\n   - restartPolicy: A", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789133111420, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

